{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mu3mqW4Sux1792990896.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產信德中心分行副分區營業經理吳炳朝表示，分行新近促成西環維壹租賃成交，單位為高層B室，實用面積662平方呎，屬2房連儲物室間隔，向北，享開揚無遮擋全海景，最新以4.5萬元租出，折合實用呎租約68元。</p><p><br/>吳炳朝表示，新租客為外國專才，心儀單位坐擁優質海景及區內獨特的生活氛圍，遂決定承租。據了解，業主於2011年以1,553萬元購入單位，持貨15年，是次出租可享約3.5厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:53.441771+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:18:10.459390+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T08:18:23.847347+00:00","content_hash":"69e189acad0b7db8c3fea9886bf8c3177efd1d78332415ae92690029e03bc9c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:21:53.441771+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}